“I’m back. Go,” he said into the phone.
She shoveled food in her mouth. The sooner she was done, the sooner
she could get away from his autocratic ass.
“Yeah.”
She glanced over and choked when she saw Roth had her notebook
open, pink pen poised over one of her lists. She snatched the book from him
and clutched it to her chest as she coughed. She doubted Roth could read
